{"title":"Grogg","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Grogg</b> is one of the four main students in the math program for 1-5 grade <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beast_Academy\" title=\"Beast Academy\">Beast Academy</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Beast_Academy_Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Beast Academy Books</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Nicknames_in_the_Beast_Academy_Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Nicknames in the Beast Academy Books</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#AoPS_Website\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AoPS Website</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Problems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problems</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Grogg&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Appearances\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Beast_Academy_Books\">Beast Academy Books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Grogg&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Beast Academy Books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Grogg is one of the main protagonists throughout the Beast Academy Books, which documents his math journey throughout grades 1 through 5 while educating readers about math concepts.\nGrogg is the large purple monster. He is somewhat of the class clown.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Nicknames_in_the_Beast_Academy_Books\">Nicknames in the Beast Academy Books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Grogg&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Nicknames in the Beast Academy Books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>- Big Purple Monster\n- Grape ape\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AoPS_Website\">AoPS Website</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Grogg&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: AoPS Website\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Schoolhouse\" title=\"AoPS Schoolhouse\">AoPS Schoolhouse</a>, it can be set so that Grogg's face appears when an emoji is generated.</li>\n<li>Pages on the AoPS website such as <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/Grogg-Not-Found\">this page</a> which are pages that are not created have a picture of Grogg on them.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Grogg&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Grogg has appeared in many problems, especially problems from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMTS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"USAMTS\">USAMTS</a> and our <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=FTW\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"FTW\">FTW</a> homepage and problems in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beast_Academy\" title=\"Beast Academy\">Beast Academy</a> books.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Grogg&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017204147\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 23/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 256/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.301      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.301      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:28773:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017204147 and revision id 285480. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}